            "text": "Professional Semi Truck Brake Service Matters"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "text-9",
          "type": "text",
          "props": {
            "align": "left",
            "width": "full",
            "text": "While replacing some parts may seem straightforward, diagnosing an air brake system requires specialized knowledge and equipment.\n\nEvery repair should include:"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "text-9-checks",
          "type": "list",
          "props": {
            "headingLevel": 3,
            "columns": 2,
            "items": [
              {
                "label": "Complete air system inspection"
              },
              {
                "label": "Brake adjustment verification"
              },
              {
                "label": "Leak testing"
              },
              {
                "label": "Component inspection"
              },
              {
                "label": "DOT compliance checks"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "text-9-b",
          "type": "text",
          "props": {
            "align": "left",
            "width": "full",
            "text": "Professional semi truck brake service helps ensure every component is functioning properly before your truck returns to the road. At Sun State International, our technicians understand heavy-duty brake systems inside and out. Whether your truck needs routine maintenance or a complete brake repair, we’ll identify the problem correctly the first time."
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "spacer-12",
          "type": "spacer",
          "props": {
            "size": 6
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "image-4",
          "type": "image",
          "props": {
            "width": "full",
            "image": {
              "src": "https://vendure.buzznerdrv.com/assets/source/21/3.3.jpg",
